flowchart LR
 K[(Main Topic)] --> C[Consumer Group]
 C --> P[Validate and Process Idempotently]
 P -->|Success| COM[Commit Progress]
 P -->|Transient Error| F[Failure Classifier]
 F --> R[(Retry Topic / Scheduler)]
 R --> C
 F -->|Permanent or Exhausted| D[(Dead-Letter Topic)]
 D --> T[Secure Triage]
 T --> RP[Approved Replay Tool]
 RP --> K
 C --> M[Lag, Age, Attempts, Error Metrics]
